      "text": "Day 3 · In the morning, an excursion by private boat to the famous Marble Caves (Catedrales de Mármol): extraordinary formations sculpted over thousands of years by the waters of Lago General Carrera, their swirling blue and white chambers among the most photographed sights in Patagonia.\n\nThe journey then continues along the Carretera Austral, past Cerro Castillo, towards Balmaceda Airport.",
